message: "If you use this software, please cite both the article and the archived software."
title: "hla-elm-toolkit-2026: reference implementation of an ELM framework for HLA resolution upgrading"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of the Extreme Learning Machine training and inference
  algorithms, the KELM/WELM/Ensemble ELM extensions, and the comparator algorithms
  described in Kepentzis et al. (Genes 2026, 17, 1239, https://doi.org/10.3390/genes17101239). Not the
  registry-scale production code; see README.md for scope.
